n (reproduced: old step exits 0 on the rewrite). Fix: anchored `grep -c '^//go:generate'` pin in the freshness step + committed `TestGenerateDirectiveStaysRecognizedForm`; the rewrite now fails the guard (exit 1) and the pin while catalog/cataloggen stay otherwise green (battery G-directive-space, behavioral suite executed).\n+- RECORDED (pre-existing, not fixed — traceability scope): `TestCIWorkflowInvokesTraceabilityGate` is a `bytes.Contains` gate over `ci.yml`: moving the Vet step's `run: go vet ./...` into a YAML comment keeps it green (doubly blind — `GOOS=windows go vet ./...` carries the same substring). Re-attacked this session (PASS on the blinded tree, ci.yml restored byte-identical). At HEAD before every leaf of both stories; named here beside the `go:generate` one per the rev2 verdict.\n+- EVIDENCE: outcome `TASK-260907-9ny4xl_outcome.md` (5/5 AC rows with call sites, battery table, tree OID, exact changed paths) + `TASK-260907-9ny4xl_mutants.log` + `TASK-260907-9ny4xl_change-request.patch` on the board task. Battery 14 applied / 14 killed / 0 survivors (narrowing 10 incl. the token-preserving directive rewrite, arm-deletion 3, census-only 1; C-old-corpus census control; NOT_APPLIED/COMPILE_FAIL distinct harness rows; audit-only 0 — no AST audit in this CR's scope).\n+- GATES: `go test ./... -count=1` exit 0 (23 ok), `-race ./...` exit 0 (23 ok, full repo), `-cover` exit 0 (cigate 90.5%, secprim 94.4%, secconftest 92.6%), `go vet` + `GOOS=windows go vet` exit 0, gofmt clean, `tracecheck` exit 0 (60 contracts / 98 cases, unchanged), catalog current, capability-claims + contract-preservation steps verbatim 6/6 + 6/6, fuzz smoke 13/13 elapsed (5 baseline-only, 8 mutation).\n+- STATUS: Ready for review, handed off to review (review/integration are orchestrator steps). Story-final CR: no board element created under STORY-260905-3t31e9; follow-up needs are listed in the outcome, not the board.\n+\n+### 33xcnc round 2: review F1/F2/F3 closed test-only, 70/71 battery on the corrected 101-exit denominator\n","edit_facts":{"tool_name":"edit_file","path":"/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/agent-session-manager/.temp/STORY-260905-3t31e9/worktree/LOGBOOK.md","added":17,"removed":3},"correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"edit_file","outcome":"success"}}}
