dForm`; defeat reproduced first (old step exits 0). Traceability Contains-blindness re-attacked and recorded as a bound (not fixed — their scope).\n\nEvidence: battery 14 applied / 14 killed / 0 survivors (narrowing 10 incl. token-preserving directive rewrite, arm-deletion 3, census-only 1; NOT_APPLIED/COMPILE_FAIL distinct; full-package runs, byte-identical restores). Full gates green: `go test ./...` 23 ok, `-race` 23 ok, `-cover`, both vets, gofmt, tracecheck, both CI steps verbatim 6/6, 13/13 fuzz elapsed. Tree OID `1ed479a…304fe6` via detached-index write-tree; no scratch files; leaves 1–5 production untouched.","reason":null}}
